    "caveats": [
      "PTEC apical shear target (0.05 Pa / 0.5 dyn/cm²) is literature-based, not from the physiology registry — confirm the physiological range for your specific PTEC line (HK-2, RPTEC/TERT1, or primary) before committing.",
      "Verify medium viscosity; if using serum-supplemented medium (~1.1e-3 Pa·s), shear will be ~10% higher at the same flow.",
